  <section class="guide-split">
    <div class="copy">
  <h2>Scheduled</h2>
  <p>A repeating payment, such as rent or a paycheque, can be scheduled. The account shows them under <strong>Upcoming</strong>, and a banner appears when one is due. A due scheduled transaction waits for you to approve it. It is not entered on its own.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shots">
      <figure class="step-shot">
        <img class="shot-light" src="/images/quick-start/cleared.jpg" width="800" height="1740" alt="The register with a scheduled transaction due, and the C that shows whether a row is cleared.">
        <img class="shot-dark" src="/images/quick-start/cleared-dark.jpg" width="800" height="1740" alt="The register with a scheduled transaction due, and the C that shows whether a row is cleared.">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Find them</h2>
  <p>The register has a search field. On the Budget tab, the filter can be saved under <strong>My Filters</strong> and turned on again later. Deleting a saved filter does not delete categories.</p>

  <h2>Receipts</h2>
  <p>On the transaction, <strong>Add Receipt</strong> attaches a photo. <strong>Scan Receipt</strong> reads one on the device, on iPhone with the camera or on Mac from a photo. The image stays with that transaction. It is not uploaded to ZxBudget.</p>
